## Third-party material

Some material in this repository is not the author's own and carries its own terms, which
take precedence over the statement above:

- **Templates.** The writing-assistance templates in
  `evaluation/prompt_ingredients/templates.csv` are derived from
  [IssueBench](https://github.com/paul-rottger/issuebench) (Röttger et al., 2025), which is
  licensed under CC-BY-4.0. That original material remains available under CC-BY-4.0 from
  its source, and its authors are credited accordingly. The Chinese translations of those
  templates are the author's own work.
- **Model completions.** The stance labels in `evaluation/analysis/master.csv` are judgments
  over completions generated by third-party language models. Those completions remain
  subject to the terms of their respective model providers.
- **Source documents.** The policy documents, official statements, and reporting quoted in
  the grounding record remain under their original licenses. They are quoted and cited here
  rather than redistributed.
